      "text_hash_scope": "main element and homepage hero; decoded text nodes; block separators; NFC; whitespace collapsed; UTF-8; extractor v1",
      "links": [],
      "description": "Truth governs logic. Logic governs reasoning. Intelligence is downstream. Governed Logic states an upstream requirement for reasoning. Governed Intelligence is the work in progress of instantiating that requirement in artificial intelligence.",
